# .gitattributes
# 文本文件统一 LF（跨平台一致）；二进制资产绝不做换行转换。
* text eol=lf

# 图片 / 图标：按字节保存（icns 曾被 `* text` 当文本转换，导致 macOS 图标损坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

# 音视频 / 字体 / 压缩包 / 可执行产物
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.asar binary

# NSIS 脚本必须是「带 BOM 的 UTF-8」：makensis 靠 BOM 判编码，任何换行/编码转换都可能让它读错
scripts/templates/*.nsi -text
